{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02679","headline":"踏歌词三首 一 · 谢偃","name":"踏歌词三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春景娇春台，新露泣新梅。\n春叶参差吐，新花重叠开。\n花影飞莺去，歌声度鸟来。\n倩看飘颻雪，何如舞袖回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谢偃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}